---
import {SQUARE_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE,SQUARE_SOURCES,SQUARE_UK_PLANS,SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS} from '@/lib/seo/squareFacts';
---
<section id="square-pricing" class="fresha-alt__section" aria-labelledby="square-alt-costs-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="fresha-alt__intro">
      <p class="fresha-alt__eyebrow">SQUARE APPOINTMENTS UK PRICING</p>
      <h2 id="square-alt-costs-title" class="fresha-alt__h2">Square Appointments pricing and fees in the UK</h2>
      <p class="fresha-alt__lead">Square has a genuinely free appointment plan. Its paid subscriptions add scheduling, reporting and team-management tools. Payments have separate processing fees, so compare the plan and the way your shop accepts money.</p>
      <p class="fresha-alt-costs__checked">Checked {SQUARE_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE} · <a href={SQUARE_SOURCES[0].url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official Square Appointments UK pricing</a></p>
    </header>
    <ul class="fresha-alt-costs__grid">
      {SQUARE_UK_PLANS.map(plan=>(<li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">SQUARE APPOINTMENTS {plan.name.toUpperCase()}</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">£{plan.monthlyGbp}</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">per month per location</p><ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes"><li>{plan.description}</li></ul></li>))}
    </ul>
    <div class="fresha-alt-costs__examples">
      <div class="fresha-alt-costs__table-wrap">
        <h3 id="square-fees-table-title" class="fresha-alt-costs__h3">Square payment processing fees: in-person, online and card on file</h3>
        <table class="fresha-alt-costs__table" aria-labelledby="square-fees-table-title">
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Payment method</th><th scope="col">Square Free</th><th scope="col">Square Plus</th><th scope="col">Square Premium</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">In-person card</th><td data-label="Square Free">{SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.inPersonFreePercent}%</td><td data-label="Square Plus">{SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.inPersonPaidPercent}%</td><td data-label="Square Premium">{SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.inPersonPaidPercent}%</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Online UK card</th><td data-label="Square Free">{SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineUkPercent}% + {SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineUkFixedPence}p</td><td data-label="Square Plus">{SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineUkPercent}% + {SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineUkFixedPence}p</td><td data-label="Square Premium">{SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineUkPercent}% + {SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineUkFixedPence}p</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Manually entered / Card on File (UK)</th><td data-label="Square Free">2.5%</td><td data-label="Square Plus">2.5%</td><td data-label="Square Premium">2.5%</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Online non-UK card</th><td data-label="Square Free">{SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineNonUkPercent}% + {SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineNonUkFixedPence}p</td><td data-label="Square Plus">{SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineNonUkPercent}% + {SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineNonUkFixedPence}p</td><td data-label="Square Premium">{SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineNonUkPercent}% + {SQUARE_UK_PAYMENT_FACTS.onlineNonUkFixedPence}p</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__note"><strong>Important:</strong> Square Online transaction rates and Square Appointments deposit rates are not interchangeable.</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__note">These are Square's published headline fees by transaction type, not a guaranteed rate for every appointment deposit. The online rates apply to specified Square Online, Online Checkout and eCommerce transactions; Card on File and manual payments use a different rate. Square's appointment-deposit processing classification has not been verified, so no deposit fee comparison is claimed. Non-UK and custom charges may differ. Square's pricing page does not establish whether £29/£69 includes VAT, so confirm the tax treatment with Square.</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__calculator">Want to compare software costs? <a href="/barber-software-cost-calculator">Explore the KERSIVO barber software cost calculator</a>. The calculator now includes Square Appointments Free, Plus and Premium plan selection. When paid-plan VAT or an Appointments deposit processing fee cannot be verified, it shows the published plan headline and clearly marks the complete cost as not estimated.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__kersivo" aria-labelledby="square-kersivo-costs-title">
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">KERSIVO</p>
        <h3 id="square-kersivo-costs-title" class="fresha-alt-costs__h3">Two paths for independent barbers</h3>
        <ul class="fresha-alt-list">
          <li>Starter: £0/month; hosted booking page for up to four active bookable barbers.</li>
          <li>Starter public bookings require a connected Stripe account and £5 deposit or full payment.</li>
          <li>Full: £39/month per location, with a branded website and standard domain.</li>
          <li>0% KERSIVO commission on bookings; Stripe fees still apply.</li>
          <li>Full includes SMS reminders, reports, advanced clients and retail pickup.</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__marketplace">
      <div class="fresha-alt-costs__marketplace-body">
        <h3 class="fresha-alt-costs__h3">Square Appointments Free vs Plus vs Premium: what's included?</h3>
        <ul class="fresha-alt-list">
          <li>Unlimited staff calendars on Free, Plus and Premium.</li>
          <li>Online booking website, text and email reminders on its Free plan.</li>
          <li>Fixed and percentage-based deposits on all three plans.</li>
          <li>Plus adds waitlists, appointment reports and cancellation/no-show rules; Premium adds advanced staff and resource tools.</li>
          <li>Square Online can also provide a full-service website, even on a free option; paid themes or extra services may cost more.</li>
          <li>Square POS and in-person card hardware are a major advantage for shops already in its ecosystem.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="fresha-alt-costs__marketplace-aside">
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__example">Square Free costs £0/month, so KERSIVO is not always the cheaper option. The choice is about what you need beyond appointments.</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__checked"><a href="https://squareup.com/help/gb/en/article/8096-deposits-on-square-appointments" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Square deposits documentation</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>